# Keeps the image build context small (spec 0002). The **/ prefix matters: a bare obj matches only
# at the root, and a host obj/project.assets.json (built for your machine) breaks publish --no-restore.
.git
docs
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/out/
**/.next/
**/TestResults/
**/.env
**/.DS_Store
